---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  Home page layout for DrXs Lab.

  A new layout rather than the gem's `about` layout: that one is built for a
  single-column personal homepage (floating profile photo, name as the page
  title), whereas this is a lab landing page with a split hero and several
  full-width sections. It is additive — no gem file is shadowed.

  Section order follows the site plan: hero → vision → directions → featured →
  collaborators. The recruiting banner is appended site-wide by
  _includes/footer.liquid, so it is deliberately absent here.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="post">
  {% include drxs/hero.liquid %}
  {%- comment -%}
    The research-vision section is intentionally not rendered. Its include and
    _data/vision.yml are kept, so adding the line back restores it.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {% include drxs/directions.liquid %}
  {% include drxs/featured.liquid %}

  {%- comment -%} News, so visitors see signs of life without a second click. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if site.news.size > 0 %}
    <section class="drxs-section" id="news">
      <div class="drxs-section-header">
        <h2 class="drxs-section-title">
          <a href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}" style="color: inherit">News</a>
          <span class="drxs-section-title-zh">新闻动态</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      {% include news.liquid limit=true %}
    </section>
  {%- endif %}

  {% include drxs/collaborators.liquid %}

  {{ content }}
</div>
